      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Model leases held and waiting",
      "description": "Calls of each project waiting for, and holding, a lease on a gateway's model, summed over the projects the filter selects. A call waits from asking for the lease until the grant, so a waiting line above zero for long is a queue on that model.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 88
